# .mailmap — normalize author display for open-source release.
#
# git log uses this to rewrite historical authors. Format:
#   <Proper Name> <proper@email> <commit@email>
#
# Pre-release: solo-dev zhangpeng authored all 50+ commits with personal email
# lodestonezhang@gmail.com. Going forward commits use the GitHub no-reply
# address (set `git config user.email lodestone@users.noreply.github.com`).
#
# This .mailmap doesn't rewrite git history — it only affects display in
# `git log`, `git shortlog`, GitHub contributor stats, etc.
zhangpeng <lodestone@users.noreply.github.com> <lodestonezhang@gmail.com>